                    by Parker; cleared by MacKnight, Sanger, Friedman, and Buffum; and approved by
                    Cleveland. Repeated to Salisbury and USUN.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d330-f2" n="1" xml:id="d330-f2-content">
                <p>Both dated August 13. (Ibid.)</p>
